{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CYYiW7b9T8mTKhchYwSiKJ","type":"tool_result","content":"# AAAI-26 Reviewer Instructions: Scoring Scale Analysis\n\nBased on the provided webpage content, **no specific reviewer scoring scale, numerical rating system, or review dimensions are detailed**.\n\nThe document outlines the review process structure (two-phase reviewing with AI-generated supplements) and provides guidelines on writing helpful reviews, but it does not include:\n\n- A numerical scoring scale (e.g., 1-10 ratings)\n- Defined review dimensions (soundness, novelty, significance, clarity, etc.)\n- Specific criteria for each score level\n- Acceptance rate information\n\nThe instructions reference that \"only the human reviews will have a paper rating and recommendations — the AI-generated reviews will not have any ratings or recommendations,\" but the actual scale and dimensions are not specified in this document.\n\n**Recommendation:** The complete scoring rubric and review criteria would likely be found in the linked document \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers\" (hosted on Google Docs) or in the full Author Kit materials, which are referenced but not fully displayed in this webpage excerpt."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"176da81f-308c-4dd6-ae97-a751123aff6c","uuid":"e2c15c7d-a2a0-4e79-ba10-9ddc1b34183a","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:41:27.535Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":204307,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# AAAI-26 Reviewer Instructions: Scoring Scale Analysis\n\nBased on the provided webpage content, **no specific reviewer scoring scale, numerical rating system, or review dimensions are detailed**.\n\nThe document outlines the review process structure (two-phase reviewing with AI-generated supplements) and provides guidelines on writing helpful reviews, but it does not include:\n\n- A numerical scoring scale (e.g., 1-10 ratings)\n- Defined review dimensions (soundness, novelty, significance, clarity, et