{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S6UxT9K78dh7vdtZdu4bXo","type":"tool_result","content":"# AAAI 2026 Reviewer Instructions - Rating Scale and Dimensions\n\nBased on the provided content, **the document does not include a specific scoring/rating scale with numerical values and labels, nor does it detail review dimensions with criteria for each score level.**\n\n## What IS Included\n\nThe instructions focus on:\n\n- **Review structure**: Paper summary (4-10 sentences), review summary (4-10 sentences), and specific feedback points\n- **Assessment areas** to address: clarity, \"technical and experimental soundness/validity, intellectual novelty, and relevance to the field\"\n- **Content guidance** for evaluations: problem clarity, limitations, technical soundness, related work placement, appropriate baselines, error analysis, and replicability\n\n## Notable Absence\n\nThe document emphasizes that reviewers should assess papers across dimensions like soundness and novelty but provides **no numerical rating scale** (such as 1-5 or 1-10) and **no explicit scoring rubric** with defined criteria levels.\n\nThe instructions note that \"only the human reviews will have a paper rating and recommendations\" but do not specify what those rating options or scales are within this particular guidance document."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"176da81f-308c-4dd6-ae97-a751123aff6c","uuid":"0cca7f79-7949-4bbb-87c9-b8697dae717e","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:42:21.020Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":128574,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# AAAI 2026 Reviewer Instructions - Rating Scale and Dimensions\n\nBased on the provided content, **the document does not include a specific scoring/rating scale with numerical values and labels, nor does it detail review dimensions with criteria for each score level.**\n\n## What IS Included\n\nThe instructions focus on:\n\n- **Review structure**: Paper summary (4-10 sentences), review summary (4-10 sentences), and specific feedback points\n- **Assessment areas** to address: clarity, \"technical and experimental soundness/validity, intellectual novelty, and relevance to the field\"\n- **Content guidance** for evaluations: problem clarity, limitations, technical soundness, related work placement, appropriate baselines, error analysis, and replicability\n\n## Notable Absence\n\nThe document emphasizes that reviewers should assess papers across dimensions like soundness and novelty but provides **no numerical rating scale** (such as 1-5 or 1-10) and **no explicit scoring rubric** with defined criteria levels.\n\nThe instructions note that \"only the human reviews will have a paper rating and recommendations\" but do not specify what those rating options or scales are within this particular guidance document.","durationMs":5094,"url":"https://docs.google.com/document/u/0/d/1tqQGwtNUlALPSTqoTo5uTFx8vKuqpILNTne9jeBCOVI/mobilebasic"}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LooahJEbubfCuoD2s8uisZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've done extensive searching for the AAAI review form scoring scale. The specific rating form with numbered scales isn't publicly available in detail. However, based on my knowledge and the AAAI 2025 statistics page, I know that AAAI historically uses a 1-10 scale for the overall assessment:\n\n- 10: Top 5% of accepted papers, seminal paper\n- 9: Strong accept, technically flawless, high impact\n- 8: Clear accept\n- 7: Accept, good paper with minor weaknesses  \n- 6: Weak accept / borderline accept\n\n\n- 5: Borderline / weak reject\n- 4: Reject, below acceptance threshold\n- 3: Clear reject, significant issues\n- 2: Strong reject\n- 1: Trivial or wrong\n\nWith AAAI 2025 having roughly a 23.4% acceptance rate and 2026 receiving around 23,000 submissions at a similar rate, I'm looking for more detailed scoring distributions on the PaperCopilot statistics page to see if there's actual rating data available.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":70683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":444},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"176da81f-308c-4dd6-ae97-a751123aff6c","uuid":"da630477-3e99-46e1-9bb5-8265a8b877cb"}
