{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jp84kZi8RY3u4dTFwDLdt9","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 gen-depth-fingerprint 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (6 个)\\n\\n- **plan-001**: ALLOCATED — \\n- **mvp-001**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp-001-gen-s0**: PREPARING — \\n- **mvp-001-gen-s3**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **mvp-001-gen-s2**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **mvp-001-gen-s1**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-14\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- plan-001: Feature ablation: 模型级特征（entropy系列+tail_decay）独立于表面特征仍能区分生成深度；H1/H2趋势分析确认特征随depth的变化模式；perplexity随depth显著变化（已分配 ? GPU:?，等待提交）\\n- mvp-001-gen-s0（准备中）\\n- mvp-001-gen-s3（准备中）\\n- mvp-001-gen-s2（准备中）\\n- mvp-001-gen-s1（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **mvp-001** (success): Pythia-410M 参考模型的分布特征（entropy stats, tail-decay, TTR, hapax）能区分 Pythia-2.8B continuation 链的 gen-0/gen-1/gen-2+，3-class macro-F1 ≥ 0.45\\n  [MVP Results](/api/workspace-files/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/artifacts/mvp-001/data/mvp_results_pointer.txt) | [MVP-001 Results](autodl-5090:/root/gen-depth-fingerprint/results/mvp_results.json)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 1 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 1\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LifoSGx9oPwZY1zX1HTfDm","session_id":"176da81f-308c-4dd6-ae97-a751123aff6c","uuid":"24f4ba5e-9168-4ee7-8933-1f4455cb5aa9","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:43:45.854Z"}
